<title>NORWAY: Storebrand stake to voting account - Tiger.</title>
<headline>Storebrand stake to voting account - Tiger.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment group Tiger Management and Merill Lynch International jointly advise that 35,482,388 shares of Norwegian insurer Storebrand ASA will be transferred from the MLI/SFG omnibus account to Tiger's voting accounts on Wednesday, Oslo Bourse said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;This is not a sale,&quot; the brief statement said.</p>
<p>No explanation was given.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
